THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

This project embeds the wasm3 WebAssembly interpreter.

  wasm3 — https://github.com/wasm3/wasm3
  Copyright (c) 2019 Steven Massey, Volodymyr Shymanskyy
  Licensed under the MIT License.
  Full text: Sources/CWasm3/LICENSE-wasm3.txt
  Vendored revision: see Sources/CWasm3/WASM3_REVISION.txt

The sample .wasm modules under sample/ are built with the WASI SDK
(https://github.com/WebAssembly/wasi-sdk), licensed under Apache-2.0 with LLVM
exceptions. The SDK is a build-time tool only: no wasi-sdk code is linked into
the runner. The sample modules do statically link wasi-libc, which is licensed
under Apache-2.0 with LLVM exceptions, MIT, and BSD-2-Clause terms; those
modules are build artifacts of sample/*.c and are provided for testing.
